# #5837, condition 4 (F1): the forward's scope runs to the link, through the donor's
# pending close.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestForwardScopeLostAtDonorClose
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the orphan's donor closes its window without a deferred bound, so its marker reads closed and a later forward is attributed to the orphan only (F1, rule S)
PERTURBS: OrphanClose
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithOrphanForward = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ oWin = "open"
    /\ oWin' = "pending"
--- REPLACE
    /\ oWin = "open"
\* MUTATION: no deferred bound; the marker reads closed.
    /\ oWin' = "closed"
--- END
